{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_08",
  "title": "激戰之末",
  "storyCode": "MB-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "da829a559f75724c97e8da41a5ea5ea2f91883a02f0bbf47a388f9f8a3493af1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你們真是搞出了不小的動靜啊，安東尼先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "要是我事先沒有知道你們的計畫，恐怕我也攔不住你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "你就是傑斯頓？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "沒錯，正是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "雖然在這座監獄中有過數次擦肩而過，不過請容許我重新自我介紹一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "我叫做傑斯頓·威廉姆斯，是你這次越獄行動中最後的阻礙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "杜瑪呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "她在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "囚犯A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜瑪",
      "text": "安東尼，對不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜瑪",
      "text": "我在醫務室等你，沒想到這個人忽然帶著一些囚犯進來了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "杜瑪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "如此陰森的地方，怎麼能讓這樣一位美麗的小姐孤單地在這裡等待呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "所以我就稍微保護了一下她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "傑斯頓先生......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "啊，羅賓小姐，你似乎失敗了，真是令人遺憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "還是說，你根本沒有執行刺殺？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "她失敗了，你的手下傷不了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "但你卻留了她一命，我不得不說，你真是一名出色的紳士，安東尼先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "廢話少說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "也好，那就讓我們直奔主題吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "安東尼先生，不想這位小姐死去的話，請過來這邊一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "卡夫卡小姐，請你乖乖地站在那裡不要動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你似乎十分擅長渾水摸魚，希望你不要擅自做一些會傷到杜瑪小姐的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "對，就站在那裡就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你們，圍住他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜瑪",
      "text": "安東尼，你別聽他的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "不要說話，杜瑪，我會救你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "危急關頭還能保持冷靜，真是令人敬佩，安東尼先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你應該知道我想要幹什麼，你也知道我不可能會忽然動了惻隱之心放過你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "我的建議是，你可以考慮拋棄這位小姐，拋棄你一直以來偽裝自己的教養，然後來與我廝殺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "廢話，少說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你能堅持到什麼時候呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "然後是你，羅賓小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "誒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "接下來，請你殺了安東尼先生，完成你未竟的任務。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "我並不在乎你在剛才與安東尼先生達成了怎樣的協定，又發生了怎樣的心境轉變。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "如果你想獲得那筆錢，如果你想救你的父親，那麼，這是你最後，也是最好的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你在猶豫什麼？是安東尼對你許諾了什麼空頭支票？還是事到如今你心軟了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "這是你唯一的機會了，羅賓小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "想想你的父親，想想你變得一團糟的生活，想想你的未來，想想你的願望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "如果我是你，我不會猶豫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "你究竟想做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "我想做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "我想做的還不明顯嗎？如果我只是想殺害你，在監獄之中我有許多機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "但這些都太沒意思了，真的，太沒意思了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "殺人這件事對我來說並沒有特別的樂趣，安東尼先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "對我來說，最有趣的部分，是改變，是人面臨抉擇時不得不拋棄過去面孔的那一瞬間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "所以我把羅賓小姐引來，渴望羅賓小姐的改變，渴望她的墮落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "也渴望你的改變，渴望你此時此刻為了你的家人，為了你的目的，而拋棄一直以來的矜持，露出你的獠牙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "啊，別裝了，安東尼先生，說真的，別裝了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "想想你的家族，想想你受的無妄之災，想想你的忍辱負重，想想你越獄的目標。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你真的甘心就這樣死在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你真的甘心為了區區一個認識幾年的女性就葬送性命？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "站起來，安東尼先生，推開羅賓小姐，忘掉杜瑪小姐，撲向我，然後殺害我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "別把所有人都想得和你一樣，傑斯頓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "別以為你與眾不同，安東尼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "我給你五秒鐘時間，羅賓小姐，時間到的話，我就會親自動手，而你，恐怕也不得不葬身此地了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "五。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "羅賓小姐，你父親的手術費還差許多，而安東尼先生現在身無分文。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "安東尼，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "四。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "安東尼先生，你的父母因為在監獄中受到排擠，過得非常不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "......父親，母親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "三。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜瑪",
      "text": "安東尼，不要管我，你不能死在這裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "囚犯A",
      "text": "哼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜瑪",
      "text": "咕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "囚犯A",
      "text": "臭女人，趁我不注意居然想自殺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜瑪",
      "text": "羅......賓......不要......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "沒想到杜瑪小姐比我想的還要剛烈，真是一位可敬的女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "真是可惜，事情沒有如她所願。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "傑，斯，頓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你現在的表情真棒，安東尼先生，真棒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "我很好奇，是什麼讓你如此堅定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "難道你認為你的死能換來我善待剩下的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "原則於你真的有這麼重要？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "還是說，你還留有後手？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "......我在這座監獄裡，做過許多違背我原則的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "對這群獄卒曲意逢迎，幫巴頓站台，打不想打的人，過不想過的生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "這與原則無關。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "這與我有關。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "我不願意為了自己的目的而犧牲杜瑪，就這麼簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "即使你的家人還在等著你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "你沒有資格評論我的家人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "即使你還有要報的仇和搞清楚的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "這些並不比一個朋友的生命重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "即使這會葬送你的性命？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "即使這會葬送我的性命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "安東尼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "你必須自己去思考每一件事，去做出每一個選擇，並為每一個選擇負責。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "否則的話，你是無法主宰自己的命運的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "你必須重新審視自己，去思考，你究竟想要做什麼事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "安東尼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "真是遺憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "那麼，二。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "羅賓小姐，我理解你的掙扎，但你必須做出選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "安東尼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "無論你做什麼選擇，都不要讓自己後悔，羅賓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "囚犯A",
      "text": "咕哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "安東尼，杜瑪交給我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "囚犯B",
      "text": "嘖！別想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嘿，我可憋好久了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "囚犯B",
      "text": "什麼時候？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "囚犯B",
      "text": "......呃啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "安東尼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "吼！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "這就是你的後手嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你斷定羅賓小姐會站在你這邊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "不，或許只是你開的條件還不夠誘人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "這樣真的好嗎，羅賓小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你選擇了一條在我看來毫無未來的道路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "爸爸變成今天那樣雖然確實是西蒙家一夜之間覆滅導致的，但是在那之後他的一蹶不振是他自己的責任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我一直是知道這一點的，我只是不願意去承認。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "而我自己......也確實不想這麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "安東尼向我許諾了他逃出去後也會幫我父親的醫藥費想辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "但其實這無所謂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我已經決定了不刺殺安東尼，即使安東尼不幫我，我也會想別的辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "而如果因為我這麼做導致了來不及醫治爸爸的病，那我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "那我會自殺，去地下向他道歉，告訴他，是女兒沒用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "這就是我的選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "漂亮，實在是漂亮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "真是令人感動的覺悟，羅賓小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "如果你是因為這樣的覺悟而選擇違背我們之間小小的協議。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "那我不僅不想責怪你，甚至想要為你鼓掌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "但我也必須要指出一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "我所說的沒有未來，並不是你們“完成越獄”之後的未來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "而是現在，此時此地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你們沒有成功逃獄的未來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "這就要試一試才知道了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "不不不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "我必須要承認，你的武力確實相當強大，安東尼先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "而對我來說，不僅是殺人，暴力也不是什麼特別有意思的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "所以為了不讓你“試一試”，杜瑪小姐只是第一步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "第二步是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "呃......啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嗚哇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜瑪",
      "text": "安東尼，卡夫卡，你們沒事吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "沒......事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你們該不會忘了自己身上還戴著枷鎖吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "可惡，這傢伙，準備得真是周全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "感謝你的讚美，卡夫卡小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "你這傢伙，從一開始就是在騙羅賓吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "不不不，我只是一向不會只做一手準備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "羅賓小姐要是得手，那我樂得清閒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "而她要是失手，你看，我也為她準備了後手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你不能說我沒有為她著想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "說得好聽，明明是你把她捲進來的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "哈哈，我從未否認我的目的是想要目睹她的掙扎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "但是卡夫卡小姐，你也是有自己事業的人，請好好想想，如果我沒有把她捲進來，她能找到方法籌齊她父親的醫藥費嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "我認為可能性很低。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "你看，你也無法反駁我，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "嘶......我不得不承認，羅賓......如果幫你......會更好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "但是，她沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "這，就，夠，了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "吼！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "居然在這種情況下還能戰鬥嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "也罷，就讓我親自來撲滅你最後的一點幻想吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "安東尼，我來幫你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嘖，我可沒有安東尼那樣的力氣啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "咦......你們當心，他的手......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "他的手，變黑了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "嘖嘖，多麼溫情脈脈的一幕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "而一想到這一幕能由我親自來打碎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "text": "我就感到十分開心啊，安東尼老弟！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
